### semicolon discards
  tokens id:f ( ) ;
  tree (; (call f (())) _)
### comparison habit
  tokens kw:if _id:x _> _int:3 _{ _id:y _}
  parse error 1:6: expected a body after 'if' (comparisons end with `?`: `x >? y`, `x <=? y`)
  | if x > 3 { y }
  |      ^
### bang habit
  tokens ! id:ready
  parse error 1:1: expected an expression, found '!' (`not x` negates, and `x not=? y` asks whether two values differ)
  | !ready
  | ^
